y=27
width=390
height=105
parent_id=com40
text_font=p12_full
text=We can only deal with reports that are sent in using the 'Report Abuse' button. Reporting players who break the rules allows us to ensure that RuneScape remains a positive and enjoyable environment for everyone. To find out more about reporting rulebreakers in RuneScape, please read the Rules of Conduct and then see our guide on reporting abuse. This can be accessed by clicking on the link: 'Customer Support' on our homepage and then 'Reporting Abuse'. 
text_shadow=yes
color=10785401

